// Fosved Office v2 — ЛЗ (Лаборатория знаний) Dispatcher (NATIVE v2.0)
import dept/utils
// World Intelligence: technology + geopolitics + economy + events
// 12 Transition Pack skills (Core:5, Domain:4, Special:3)
// + 8 hard rule gates (confirmation, timeline, negative-signal, hype-vs-flows,
//   osp-referral, emission-check, competing-check, cross-domain-check)
// + LIFECYCLE: tracking→hot→confirmed_disruption / tracking→cooled / tracking→failed
// + 5 scan horizons: real-time (Tavily), 4h incremental, daily digest, weekly inflection, monthly re-scoring
// + CROSS-DEPT: LZ→OSP (disruption≥70%), LZ→KK (arsenal review), LZ→Finance (VC signal)
// + DISCLAIMER: no investment advice, no disruption alert without 3 confirmations, no ignore negative signals
// + DB SCHEMA inline (KnowledgeArtifact, TrackedTechnology, ScanLog, WatchlistEntry, DisruptionAlert)
// Sources: library/lz.md v2.0, skills_index/lz.txt, transition-pack skills/fosved/lz/ (12)

